om/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122705","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122705","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122705.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122705.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nPreviously, when pasting a node via the right-click menu, the node wouldn't be position where the click occurred, but rather be offset by the parent's transform. This happened because the code used `ci->get_global_transform_with_canvas()` in order to negate that, but since the pasted node wasn't parented yet, it did nothing.\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes that by getting the parent using the current selection, and if empty, the root node. Then getting the transform from that.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122705/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122705/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}